# DEKOPEN — Cursor rules

Read `AGENTS.md`, then the Constitution, roadmap, active shot plan and affected PRDs. Preserve
the repository invariants: Decimal and pure `/engine`, 0.00 mm deterministic outputs, RLS
isolation, pre-write auditing, idempotent payments and semantic CSS tokens.

Run focused checks for the changed proof surface. The canonical Gauntlet
(`python scripts/check_dod.py all`) closes the final material implementation head of a SHOT;
documentation-only and contained follow-ups use their affected gates. Protected CI remains the
independent integration verdict.

Use autonomous engineering judgment for reversible non-material choices. Stop only for a
material contradiction, a material gap under Rule 20, or an unauthorized irreversible action.
Never weaken tests, checker logic, Golden or branch protection.
